{"video":"YJR238M6XJA","lines":[{"t":[0.8,2.6],"en":"- Thanks for inviting me along."},{"t":[2.6,4],"en":"- Oh, sure."},{"t":[4,5.4],"en":"Really didn't give it any thought."},{"t":[5.4,6.6],"en":"Wait, should you be going?"},{"t":[9.4,11],"en":"Hello, you."},{"t":[11,12.4],"en":"- Michael? - Hey, Buttercup."},{"t":[12.4,13.4],"en":"- Hi. - I am on my way."},{"t":[13.4,14.8],"en":"Should be there in about 15--"},{"t":[14.8,16.4],"en":"- Let me blow this party off."},{"t":[16.4,17.3],"en":"- That's what she said."},{"t":[17.3,18.5],"en":"- Yeah."},{"t":[18.5,19.8],"en":"Am I on speakerphone?"},{"t":[19.8,21.7],"en":"- Ah, yes, you are."},{"t":[21.7,22.9],"en":"- Who is anybody else?"},{"t":[22.9,23.9],"en":"- Hello, Jan."},{"t":[23.9,24.8],"en":"- Hi, Dwight."},{"t":[24.8,26.8],"en":"Okay, Michael, take me off speakerphone."},{"t":[26.8,28.2],"en":"- No problem."},{"t":[30,32.9],"en":"- Okay, let's just go to a motel and just, like,"},{"t":[32.9,35.5],"en":"rip into each other like we did on the Black Sand Beach"},{"t":[35.5,36.8],"en":"in Jamaica."},{"t":[36.8,39.4],"en":"- Okay, Jan, Jan, this party is actually"},{"t":[39.4,41.9],"en":"a very big step for us, so I--"},{"t":[41.9,43.3],"en":"- Still on speaker?"},{"t":[43.3,46.1],"en":"- Um, I, I don't know."},{"t":[46.1,47.4],"en":"- The camera's there?"},{"t":[47.4,48.8],"en":"- Maybe."},{"t":[48.8,50.5],"en":"- Okay, see you soon."},{"t":[50.5,51.8],"en":"- Okay. - We'll talk to you later, Jan."},{"t":[51.8,53],"en":"- All right, bye."},{"t":[54.4,56.2],"en":"- Beauty."},{"t":[56.2,57.1],"en":"Thank you, sir."},{"t":[57.1,59],"en":"- That's a lot of, thank y'all."},{"t":[60,63.8],"en":"You're dressed exactly like the servants."},{"t":[63.8,64.9],"en":"- Shut up."},{"t":[64.9,67],"en":"- Okay, change shirts."},{"t":[67,67.9],"en":"- Wait."},{"t":[67.9,70.3],"en":"- I don't think yours will fit me."},{"t":[70.3,71.3],"en":"- I don't care."},{"t":[78.1,79.5],"en":"- Oh, wow."},{"t":[79.5,84.5],"en":"- Here, don't put my jacket on, don't give me that."},{"t":[84.5,87.5],"en":"- That would've been really embarrassing."},{"t":[87.5,90.1],"en":"- Yes, crisis averted."},{"t":[90.1,91],"en":"- Okay."},{"t":[92.7,94.4],"en":"- Hi."},{"t":[94.4,98.8],"en":"- Actually, it's polite to arrive early, and smart."},{"t":[99.7,102.3],"en":"Only really good friends show up early."},{"t":[102.3,104.8],"en":"Ergo de facto, go to a party early,"},{"t":[104.8,106.3],"en":"become a really good friend."},{"t":[106.3,108.3],"en":"- Oh, a potato salad."},{"t":[108.3,109.3],"en":"- That's from both of us."},{"t":[109.3,110.4],"en":"- No, it's not."},{"t":[110.4,111.8],"en":"- Okay, wonderful."},{"t":[111.8,114.9],"en":"- Let's, uh, see where we can put this."},{"t":[116.6,118.7],"en":"- Oh, you know, you probably want to leave the cover on"},{"t":[118.7,120.3],"en":"until the guests get here."},{"t":[120.3,122.8],"en":"- It's been sitting in my car all day."},{"t":[124,125.8],"en":"The sun beating down on the mayonnaise."},{"t":[126.8,129.9],"en":"Just, you never know."},{"t":[129.9,132],"en":"♪"}]}
